  {
   "f": "Subtracting algebraic fractions: key trap",
   "b": "Bracket the whole second numerator so the minus applies to every term."
  },
  {
   "f": "Dividing algebraic fractions",
   "b": "Factorise everything, flip the second fraction, cancel, then multiply."
